  "notes": "{散|ち}らす means to scatter or spread things in different directions.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{散|ち}る→散る：02075_chiru⟧ (intransitive, to scatter by itself)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{散|ち}らしている indicates things are scattered about or that scattering is ongoing.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{花|はな}びら→花びら：13988_hanabira⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{散|ち}らす: to scatter petals\n- ⟦{気|き}→気：02199_ki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{散|ち}らす: to distract (someone's mind)\n- ⟦{注意|ちゅうい}→注意：01464_chuui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{散|ち}らす: to distract attention\n- ⟦ばらばら→ばらばら：05165_barabara⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{散|ち}らす: to scatter everywhere\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n⟦{散|ち}らかす→散らかす：04360_chirakasu⟧: to make a mess, leave things scattered",
